    <string name="crypto_consent">Prices come from Kraken (api.kraken.com), the exchange\'s public prices. No key is needed. BentoBar asks for the coins you chose about every 2 minutes while the bar is on screen (a failed try is repeated later); Kraken sees your IP address, as any website does.</string>
